  '凉茶制作步骤':'Herbal-tea preparation','选择材料':'Choose materials','加水煎煮':'Add water and simmer','过滤倒出':'Filter and pour','饮用':'Drink','播放过程':'Play sequence','凉茶从选材到饮用的制作顺序':'Herbal tea from ingredients to cup','演示选择植物材料、加水煎煮、过滤倒入杯中和饮用四个可观察步骤。':'Four observable steps: choose plant materials, simmer, filter, and drink.','按配方选择植物材料':'Choose plant materials for the recipe','水与材料一起煎煮':'Simmer materials in water','过滤后倒入杯中':'Filter and pour into a cup','一杯饮料，也是一种地方习惯':'A drink—and a local habit','这里演示的是可观察的制作过程。传统所说的“清热、祛湿”等概念，不等同于物理学中的温度与空气湿度。':'This shows an observable preparation process. Traditional ideas of “heat” and “dampness” are not the same as physical temperature and air humidity.',
